  "2026-10-19T13:34:51.001Z",codex-agent,"Private aggregate review exposed false supersession proposals from equivalent negated guidance. Tightened consolidation to normalize negated enable/disable, require exclusive opposing signals, and require matching remaining guidance for always/never. Added a 48-case signal matrix plus explicit equivalent, ambiguous and changed-action cases. Dry runs remain read-only."
  "2026-10-19T13:36:00.994Z",codex-agent,"Additional behavioral revert proof: restore only opposite() from the initial implementation commit. npm run build passes; node --test --test-name-pattern=\"consolidation respects\" test/edges.test.ts fails with AssertionError, exit 1. Restore current opposite(): the same test passes. Consolidation plus edge suite: 8 passed, zero failed."
  "2026-10-19T13:41:25.642Z",codex-agent,"Accepted private consolidation aggregate after negation correction: zero duplicate merges, one supersession and 189 archive proposals. Dry run only; no proposals applied. Synthetic merge/supersession/archive and negation matrix tests passed."
  "2026-10-19T14:01:15.031Z",codex-agent,"Archive proposals now require a confident persisted stale reason, no recalls, no pin, and updated_at age at least --min-age-days (default 30). Dry run remains read only; boundary regression added."
  "2026-10-19T14:30:14.026Z",codex-agent,"Final private dry run proposes 0 merges, 1 supersession and 0 archives, versus 0/1/189 previously. Fresh native updated_at values fail the default 30-day age threshold; stale archive proposals also require a confident reason, zero recalls and no pin. Nothing applied."
